Z||000015||Homicidal||05-13-2000||03:13 AM||||Just for the record, that is not a full limo. It is a Mini-Limo.  It is a Chryslyer.  Not many around anymore.  Cost around 15K, but it sells for probably double that in good condition. The interior is a bit messed up but we are getting it fixed soon.  <P>It is bigger than a car, smaller than a limo.  Is has 2 jump seats, a privacy window and a radio in the back.  I plan to inherit it from my parents and make it a project to deck it out with a new paint job, new sound system and a huge overhaul on the engine.||||reg||1
